WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.109 --> 00:00:01.090
(peaceful music)

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:03.880
- [Narrator] A two-hour boat
ride off the coast of Colombia

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:08.561
is an island, the most
densely-populated island on earth.

00:00:08.561 --> 00:00:10.978
(chattering)

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:19.240
Santa Cruz del Islote consists
of more than 1,200 people

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:22.630
living on land the size
of two soccer fields,

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:25.483
making it four times
as dense as Manhattan.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:31.620
On the island is a school
that runs up to the 10th grade,

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:34.420
two shops, and one restaurant.

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:36.810
There is no steady supply of water

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:41.430
and a sole generator that only
runs for five hours per day.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:44.400
There are no police, but there
isn't much need for them,

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.852
as everyone on the
island knows each other.

00:00:46.852 --> 00:00:48.710
(children chattering)

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:52.540
150 years ago, the island
was primarily uninhabited

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:54.780
and was sometimes used by local fishermen

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:58.230
as a place to rest and
take shelter during storms.

00:00:58.230 --> 00:01:01.380
Gradually, some fishermen came
to build their homes here.

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:03.660
These were the grandparents
and great-grandparents

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:05.933
of the current generation of residents.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.920
Despite the close living quarters,

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:11.210
inhabitants on the island
say they wouldn't give up

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:13.410
their peaceful existence for anything,

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:15.283
not even a little more room.

00:01:16.143 --> 00:01:18.560
(chattering)

00:01:20.769 --> 00:01:23.769
(peaceful jingling)

